<title>SINGAPORE: SIA in talks for Sempati Air stake - TV.</title>
<headline>SIA in talks for Sempati Air stake - TV.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Airlines Ltd (SIA) is in talks to buy a stake in Indonesia's PT Sempati Air, Singapore state television said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The report said SIA had confirmed it was in ongoing discussions for an equity-based relationship with Sempati, but the company had declined to give further details.</p>
<p>SIA officials were not immediately available for comment on the television report.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703011)</p>
